      "prompt": "A polygon has 8 sides. 7 of its interior angles are each 148°, and the remaining interior angle is (2x + 12)°. Find x.",
      "solution_steps": [
        "Sum of interior angles = (n - 2) × 180 = (8 - 2) × 180 = 1080°",
        "Sum of the 7 equal angles = 7 × 148 = 1036°",
        "Remaining angle = 1080 - 1036 = 44°",
        "2x + 12 = 44",
        "Subtract 12 from both sides:",
        "2x = 32",
        "Divide both sides by 2:",
        "x = 16"
      ],
      "final_answer": "16",
      "marks": 5,
      "mark_scheme": [
